          <div class="b8-cp"><div><h3>1. Every feed, read together</h3><p>Off-market, MLS, public records, new development, pre-development and cash discounts land in one place instead of six tabs.</p></div><div><h3>4. A match report, ready</h3><p>Your best fit comes back as a short report, with the building research behind it. How the fit score works is explained in the sample dossier below.</p></div></div>
