    </div>
    <ol class="mm-steps" aria-label="How a match is made">
      <li><b>1</b><h3>Understand you</h3><p>Where you want to live, how many rooms, your budget, your timing and how you want to live.</p></li>
      <li><b>2</b><h3>Research six sources</h3><p>Off-market, MLS, public records, new development, pre-development and cash discounts.</p></li>
      <li><b>3</b><h3>Evaluate against you</h3><p>Buildings and individual homes are weighed against your criteria, not just your price.</p></li>
      <li><b>4</b><h3>Rank the strongest</h3><p>The closest matches rise to the top, across four price points.</p></li>
      <li><b>5</b><h3>Deliver your Kammer Report</h3><p>A personalized decision dossier, with the reasons behind every ranking.</p></li>
      <li><b>6</b><h3>Keep watching</h3><p>Three months of monitoring, so a match that opens later still finds you.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap quiz" id="quiz" aria-labelledby="quiz-h">
    <div class="qx">
      <div class="qx-form">
    <div class="eyebrow">Four questions</div>
    <h2 id="quiz-h">Tell us what you need.</h2>

    <form id="match-form">
      <fieldset>
        <legend>Where would you live?</legend>
        <div class="opts">{hoods.map((h) => <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="hood" value={h} required /><span>{h}</span></label>)}</div>
      </fieldset>
      <fieldset>
        <legend>How many bedrooms?</legend>
        <div class="opts">{beds.map((b) => <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="beds" value={b} required /><span>{b === 3 ? "3 or more" : b}</span></label>)}</div>
      </fieldset>
      <fieldset>
        <legend>What is your budget?</legend>
        <div class="opts">{lanes.map((l) => <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="lane" value={l.id} required /><span>{l.label}</span></label>)}</div>
      </fieldset>
      <fieldset>
        <legend>What must it have? (optional)</legend>
        <div class="opts">{traits.map((t) => <label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="trait" value={t} /><span>{t}</span></label>)}</div>
      </fieldset>
      <button class="btn" type="submit">Show my match <svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ar" /></svg></button>
    </form>

    <article id="match" class="match" hidden aria-live="polite"></article>
    <p class="next-line"><b>What happens next:</b> you see a free sample match right here. To get your personalized Kammer Report, request it afterwards.</p>
    <p class="small">General information only, not legal, tax or financial advice. Free to try, with no card needed.</p>
      </div>
